{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさまこんばんわ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもいつもお世話になっています！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"7月17日で18歳になりました！\n北野日奈子です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/07/17/0738283/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46に加入してから二度目のお誕生日を迎えることができました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一年前の私と今日の私を比較した時\nどのくらい成長できているのか。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分では分からないけど、\n皆さんのおかげで確実に\n成長できていると思います！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は純奈と伊織とダンスの練習をしていて、この後も伊織とダンスの練習をするので、お誕生日についてはまた少し次のブログでかきます♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/07/17/0738283/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あしゅさんが、作ってくれました♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あしゅさん、だいすき♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/07/17/0738283/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさま！たくさんのコメントありがとうございます♡また、ゆっくり読ませて頂きます٩(ˊᗜˋ*)و"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また、すぐブログ書きます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/07/17/0738283/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"